{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b29c043a81846698","name":"Missile Load","source":{"id":"source:reference-b29c043a81846698","title":"Missile Load","revision":19714,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:28:40Z","sha256":"3338dd935febd451ac1a6aac5730feb4ffb21fb1ab52112a8c9d4a6888adcfab","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19714","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Missile%20Load&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b29c043a81846698","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 250\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Grenade's charge can be converted into a missile warhead. Once turned into a missile, the device cannot be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"},". The primary advantages of Missile Loads are their greater effect and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"}," when fired from a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Missile Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Missile_Launcher","referenceId":"reference:f5c813188b5889e5"},". (The standard missile is essentially a Missile Load for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenade","referenceId":"reference:5d38df4b2da8b77e"},", so only ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Balls"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Balls"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion_Grenades"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun Grenades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun_Grenades"}," can be fitted as Missile Loads.)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Increase the damage dice of the original ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grenade"}," by 50% when converted to a Missile Load. For example, an Energy Missile deals 3d8 damage, and a Stun Missile deals 6d6 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
